const faq = [['Can I still get the 30% federal tax credit for a home battery?','No. Under Public Law 119-21 (the One Big Beautiful Bill), the Section 25D Residential Clean Energy Credit does not apply to installations completed after 12/31/2025, per the IRS FAQ.'],['Did the heat pump tax credit end too?','Yes. The Section 25C Energy Efficient Home Improvement Credit, which was 30% up to $3,200 a year, does not apply to property placed in service after 12/31/2025.'],['Is there a federal credit for portable power stations?','Our data shows no federal credit for portable power stations. Some California utilities offer rebates in wildfire areas.']];
